        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "2.白天，魔法大学（64.122）流浪占卜师对话，选“是”交出100魔币、【占卜信】，获得【占卜结果】。",
      "type": "timed-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "3.里谢里雅堡（48.57）天文大臣对话。交出【占卜结果】获得【咨询信】。",
      "type": "exchange-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "4.夜晚，到魔法大学（64.122）流浪占卜师对话，说“占卜...”，交出【咨询信】，获得【咨询结果】。",
